        },
        {
          "text": "Nyama yesu ili mbubonya mbuli nyama yabakwesu, abana besu bali mbubonya mbuli bana babo, nekubaboobo tulauzya bana besu balombe abana besu basimbi kuti babe bazike. Bamwi bana basimbi besu baulwa kale, nkabela tatukonzyi kubanununa, nkaambo myuunda yesu amyuunda yamasaansa yesu ili mumaanza aabantu bambi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.5.5",
