        {
          "text": "Mpawo ndaka ti, Cintu eci ncimucita taciboti pe. Sa tamweelede kweenda mukuyoowa Leza wesu, nkaambo kakusampaulwa kulibamasi basinkondoma besu? ",
          "type": "text",
