        {
          "text": "Beendelezi bataanzi ibakanditaangunina bakalemena bantu, batambula kulimbabo insima awaini amasyekeli aansiliva aali makumi one. Abalo bana babo, bakaba abwami bwakweendelezya bantu, Pele mebo teendakacita obo pe, nkaambo kakuyoowa Leza. ",
          "type": "text",
