        },
        {
          "text": "Ayalo milimo eyo yakuyaka bulambo, ndakakakatila kulinjiyo, Tcetwakavuba myuunda pe. Bana bangu boonse bakayoboloka nkuko kukubeleka milimo, ",
          "type": "text",
