        },
        {
          "text": "Zilyo nzindakabambilwa buzuba bumwi abumwi nzeezi: omwe musune, ambelele imbotu zili musanu aimwi, abayuni mbundakacitilwa, Alimwi komwe mumazuba aali ikumi ndakabambilwa wanu munji wamisyobo misyobo, Nekubaboobo teendakatambula zilyo zyabweendelezi, nkaambo bantu bakalemenwa. ",
